{"ref":"BDB, רֶ֫גֶשׁ","hw":"רֶ֫גֶשׁ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫גֶשׁ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>throng</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נְהַלֵּךְ בְּרָ֑גֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:15\" href=\"/Psalms.55.15\">ψ 55:15</a> used to walk <em>in the throng</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, הָמוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_הָמוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">הָמוֹן</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:5\" href=\"/Psalms.42.5\">42:5</a>, also to <span dir=\"rtl\">ביח אלהים</span>).","next":"BDB, רִגְשָׁה","prev":"BDB, רָגַשׁ"}